  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28559001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "模仿「奥古斯都」的建筑风格的别墅，露天的庭院……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还有一处小型的马球场。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "谢谢，我能看到您的用心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "对贵族来说，这些都显得很普通吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "并非如此——请将您的手伸出来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "庭院里，伊迪丝微微俯身，右手搭上了你的指腹，乐声缓缓流淌。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "愿意与我共舞吗，我的骑士？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "……比起上一次，您的步伐娴熟了不少。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "为了跟上你，我私下练习过。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "当初青涩笨拙的舞步倒是显得可爱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "现在的成长也着实令人欣喜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "在舞步渐臻完美时，两人相互凝望。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "舞会总有散场的时候，但是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28559016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "|101|，夜晚还很漫长。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
